        {
            "title": "華虹宏力及濰柴動力成恒指新貴",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指公司公布，華虹宏力(01347)及濰柴動力(02338)獲納入恒指成份股，成份股由93隻增至95隻。恒生科技指數納入上海天數智芯(09903)，剔除同程旅行(00780)。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：華虹官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250108_FI_source-web_01347.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：華虹官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250108_FI_source-web_01347.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：華虹官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生生物科技指數加入杭州德適生物科技(02526)，剔除和黃醫藥(00013)。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16613682-%e8%8f%af%e8%99%b9%e5%ae%8f%e5%8a%9b%e5%8f%8a%e6%bf%b0%e6%9f%b4%e5%8b%95%e5%8a%9b%e6%88%90%e6%81%92%e6%8c%87%e6%96%b0%e8%b2%b4",
