ecial-color\">港股 AP圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：智譜官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"紫金黃金國際官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/601899-Web2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">紫金黃金國際官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：石藥集團官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/20241115_FI_source-web_01093.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：石藥集團官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"資料圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/02/20240530_fi_aia_01299_1200.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">資料圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"港股 AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250408_FI_source-ap_Hong_Kong_Trump_Tariffs-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"港股 AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250408_FI_source-ap_Hong_Kong_Trump_Tariffs-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">港股 AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數全日升310點或1.21%，報26,009，為全日高位，今早開升109點或0.42%，報25,807，已為全日低位，午後升破上午高位，競價時段抽上，突破26,000關，以全日高位收市。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數全日升65點或1.4%，報4,766; 今早開升9點或0.21%，報4,710。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生國企指數全日升86點或1.01%，報8,634，今早開升31點或0.37%，報8,579。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交2,572.77億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">隔晚美急挫，亞洲台、日、韓股市俱跌，惟港股逆市升。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">一周累計，恒指累升893點或3.55% ; 科指一周升59點或1.25% ; 國指升294點或3.52%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">即月期指升   點或   ，報    ; 恒生科技指數報  ，升  點或   % ; 恒生國企指數升36點或0.42%，報8,584。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：智譜官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/12/20251211_FI_source-web_Zhipu-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：智譜官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指收市後公布季檢結果，市傳智譜(02513)、MINIMAX(00100)及紫金黃金國際(02259)有機會染藍，智譜午後顯著上揚，收升10.36%，報1,129元，除了炒染藍外，智譜參與融資具身大模型企原力靈機，傳啟動次輪融資 ; 國家超算互聯網上線，智譜新一代基座模型GLM-5.3 API調用服務。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">MINIMAX飆11.86%，收報347.2元。    </p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">紫金黃金國際(02259)升8.09%，報160.3元，其他黃金相關股也造好，老鋪黃金(06181)升7.46%，報397.8元，為表現最佳藍籌股 ; 紫金礦業(02899)升4.9%，報38.56元。       </p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"紫金黃金國際官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/601899-Web2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"紫金黃金國際官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/09/601899-Web2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">紫金黃金國際官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">業績股成為焦點，恒地(00012)全日升7.17%，報30.2元，升幅藍籌股中居第二位。半年基礎盈利升66%，勝市場預期。。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)先升後跌，收跌2.54%，報123元，成交居首，影響恒指51點，成壓抑大市主力，首財季經調整盈利跌38%; 網易(09999)升4.45%，報202元，次季經調整盈利跌19%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中國平安(02318)全日3.88%，報56.2元，半年新業務價值248.47億元(人民幣‧下同)，按年升11.2%。歸屬母公司股東淨利潤925.85 億元，按年升36.1%，派中期息0.98元，按年升3.2%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">極兔速遞(01519)升3.79%，報10.42元。中期純利增189.5%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">泡泡瑪特(09992)挫3.06%，報149元，中期多賺9.5%，不派中期息，跌幅藍籌股中居第二位。以LABUBU為代表的THE MONSTERS家族收入44.54億元，按年減少7.5%，公司稱無法完成定下收入增長20%目標。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">藥業股回落，石藥(01093)挫3.47%，報9.19元，為表現最差藍籌股，翰森製藥(03692)跌1.78%，報33.08元。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：石藥集團官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/20241115_FI_source-web_01093.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：石藥集團官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/20241115_FI_source-web_01093.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：石藥集團官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">金融股撐市，友邦(01299)升3.3%，報75.15元，貢獻恒指38點 ; 滙控(00005)升1.62%，報162.9元，貢獻恒指36點，為升市主力。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">其他科網股個別發展，小米(01810)升4.54%，報29.02元，貢獻恒指35點; 騰訊(00700)升1.24%，報457元。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"資料圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/02/20240530_fi_aia_01299_1200.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/02/20240530_fi_aia_01299_1200.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">資料圖片</p>\n</a>\n</div>",
